  "id": "347ed3df1ac5acf6bb168030",
  "title": "人生流水事紀",
  "summary": "瑣碎、沒人在乎，但卻對我很重要的一些人、一些時刻。",
  "content": "<p>瑣碎、沒人在乎，但卻對我很重要的一些人、一些時刻。</p>\n<img src=\"https://shuojen.com/assets/images/001-0e2113b3b15f40bcd107b85005d18294.jpg\" width=\"300\" alt=\"img\">\n\n\n\n\n<div><div><div><div>1998</div><p>出生於臺北</p></div></div><div><div><div>2004</div><p>上小學，第一次搬家\n認識<a href=\"https://shuojen.com/photoblog/2026/05/16/tamsui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">王胖</a>、<a href=\"https://shuojen.com/blog/2026/06/26/hobby\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">翁伯伯</a> \n開始學<a href=\"https://shuojen.com/docs/music/piano\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">鋼琴</a></p></div></div><div><div><div>2008</div><p>解開人生第一顆<a href=\"https://shuojen.com/docs/rubiks_cube/competition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">魔術方塊</a></p></div></div><div><div><div>2010</div><p>上國中，認識<a href=\"https://shuojen.com/photoblog/2023/11/30/trip\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">大隊長、盧董</a>、<a href=\"https://shuojen.com/photoblog/2023/02/28/trip\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">築雅</a></p></div></div><div><div><div>2013</div><p>上<a href=\"https://shuojen.com/blog/2026/05/20/highschool\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">高中</a>，認識<a href=\"https://shuojen.com/photoblog/2020/09/25/wolf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">蒜頭</a>、<a href=\"https://shuojen.com/blog/2016/08/29/friend\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">肥凱</a>、雅婷</p></div></div><div><div><div>2014</div><p>學烏克麗麗之後加入<a href=\"https://shuojen.com/docs/music/guitar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">吉他</a>社，第一首學會的曲子是「痛哭的人」</p></div></div><div><div><div>2016</div><p>上大學，認識<a href=\"https://shuojen.com/photoblog/2025/02/18/korea\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">咩咩、阿楷、嘉琪</a>、<a href=\"https://shuojen.com/photoblog/2020/08/01/trip\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">阿簡、家豪</a></p></div></div><div><div><div>2017</div><p>開始喜歡看<a href=\"https://shuojen.com/docs/movie_list\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">電影</a>。每天晚上跟家豪一起熬夜刷 imdb 榜上的電影</p></div></div><div><div><div>2018</div><p>開始玩<a href=\"https://shuojen.com/docs/aqua\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">水族</a>。跟咩咩、阿楷一起在租房處養魚，阿楷養海水缸，我跟咩咩玩孔雀魚</p></div></div><div><div><div>2019</div><p>從<a href=\"https://shuojen.com/blog/2026/03/20/camera\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">底片相機</a>開始<a href=\"https://shuojen.com/blog/2019/05/11/friend\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">喜歡上攝影</a>\n入手人生第一臺<a href=\"https://shuojen.com/blog/2026/06/18/motorcycle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">檔車</a></p></div></div><div><div><div>2020</div><p>畢業後<a href=\"https://shuojen.com/blog/2020/06/30/goodbye\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">登出斗六</a>，回台北重考研究所</p></div></div><div><div><div>2021</div><p>上研究所，認識峻寶寶、<a href=\"https://shuojen.com/photoblog/2023/03/07/trip\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">冠宏</a>、倪哥、蕭告、競賽\n看了<a href=\"https://shuojen.com/docs/chess/chess_start\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">《后翼棄兵》</a>後開始學<a href=\"https://shuojen.com/docs/chess/chess_start\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">西洋棋</a></p></div></div><div><div><div>2022</div><p>魔術方塊官方紀錄單次 8.81，達到目標後半退坑\n入手人生第一張滑板\n參加人生第一場<a href=\"https://shuojen.com/docs/chess/competition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">西洋棋比賽</a></p></div></div><div><div><div>2023</div><p><a href=\"https://shuojen.com/photoblog/2023/08/03/417\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">離校</a>後當兵，開始人生第一份正式工作</p></div></div><div><div><div>2024</div><p>與<a href=\"https://shuojen.com/photoblog/2025/02/19/bo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">蝦波</a>開始交往\n年底開始人生第二份正式工作</p></div></div><div><div><div>2025</div><p>開始寫<a href=\"https://shuojen.com/blog/2025/12/31/blog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">部落格</a>，發現自己的人生除了自己，沒有人會幫你回顧</p></div></div><div><div><div>2026</div><p>與蝦波和<a href=\"https://shuojen.com/blog/2026/02/12/bpo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">嗶寶</a>同居</p></div></div></div>",
